# The reactos-liminal commit that builds QAGRR. Read by build-with-rl.sh: the first line that is not a comment is the full commit hash.
# The reactos-liminal commit that builds QAGRR. It is the merge of reactos-liminal pull request 40 on main (the compact trim drops the Logon ScreenSaver and keeps Blank screen, `ScreenSaverIsSecure` is cleared), on top of main with the Afterglow savers build (pull request 39, RL-67) and the round-4 icons. The Quill remix adds AGQUILL.SCR (Ghostwriter) on top. Pull request 41 (the exact magenta key for the Display Properties monitor) is not in it; move this once that merges. To move: set a newer commit, then run
# `build-with-rl.sh --check-trim` and a dry run.
